<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army sentenced five former soldiers to reparations work for executions, while a bomb hit a police patrol near a Carabineros school in Cali without causing injuries. A coal mine explosion killed two workers and left two missing, and a bus overturning in southwestern Colombia killed eight people and injured twenty. A separate bus crash on a motorway killed six after the driver fell asleep. Social leaders remain targeted, with more than 45 killed in the first 100 days of the current administration. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNaXNsLTVsbnVYNlFBZ3pPTnJpZlpxVkc2bUU3MF8tc3JiTDhFTExDdmpkREpyVXNxUjlqaFpJYUprUkl0VklTWWNBZXVVdkZyZTZHWUE2Z3pSamhnTWRBVkxIcV9vOTItX3U5c1VaeDRFcGlhWWpBNjR0cE1sU2RMU0oxNGpNMXlVMllVY00wdmNtdmZISUFFa0V2dEVlN0RqekZKekMyNEFHeEVFMUZtclF2MGxaSkVXTFlkdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;teleSUR English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNRXBrYzRVVS1jUTNOS0xYSTF3anJPQmRfZ0tvT1lTOWlwZnczTDBaV084RUswdnNDNjd3TjhUZ3dwYVd6UnplZUk3TndPRGdYX21jalA3Y3UtOEFJb0xXSVRaNmRJS0R0Qm5tOURJNllkV3lvYk9NclROY2hZYjNQZmhjUTg3MDJNYmxhRkhlX0tjTHFUajFucEF1YU5TeGZjNDZMMVhxZmE0UkN6cTd0M1EtUzd5RW_SAbwBQVVfeXFMUF9HMWw3NVN0LXVDdmhqcC1oQzd6dkZ3VW5BM2ZGcVZ4RnRHZ1Z4M3FoVEEyS3RyTUQ0YW14NDMtc0lwMEZhZ3gzNTVqaF8xdVBOdzRONkR5c0kxbHQxM05QNXE0QV81X2E3bHRLdUFMM0paTkFZS1pGRVowVGd5QmJid3NxWTR1c3E4XzFtanluZE5HaWJRckEzVEFiaG5JRXJ0Wnoza3gycU9vU2I3cjJXMzA0Z1pQczFyclo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNREFaUTJTUmo2cWE0Ym9QajBMaVllNWxhTzBrX1NKZjdmbFVqaGItNnRKaUpxSXg2aGdzVlRiWU5tcWo5TWVHdEN2VE1xYkhhVkxWdWR5RGZwUE5FcGJYa1pSM3hSbjhvZ1ZuYmpQdHZGaEs0SkIyYmRBU2